; Project-level npm config for the IRIS/Angular ClientApp.
; Scopes @oneidentity packages to the One Identity Azure Artifacts feed.
; Public packages continue to resolve from the default npmjs registry.
;
; NO secret/token is stored here. Authenticate once per machine with:
;     npm i -g vsts-npm-auth        (if not already installed)
;     vsts-npm-auth -config .npmrc  (run from this ClientApp folder)
; which writes a token to your USER-level ~/.npmrc (outside the repo).
;
; Registry (org-scoped feed, no project segment):
@oneidentity:registry=https://pkgs.dev.azure.com/1id/_packaging/OneIdentity/npm/registry/
